==================== Input ====================
// The content after a block comment ending its source line starts the next line, as written:
// a `-next-line` directive keeps its target (DIVERGENCES.md#block-comment-ending-line)
a {
  margin:
    /* stylelint-disable-next-line */
    1px 2px;
  padding: 1px
    /* stylelint-disable-next-line */
    2px;
  font-family: a,
    /* stylelint-disable-next-line */
    b;
  color: /* same-line, ending its line */
    red;
}

$map: (
  /* comment */
  key1: value,
);

